@startuml SD-2f
!include ../_style.iuml
title SD-2f (Software level, CSMS billing) — «planned» Driver closes the account and unused credit is refunded\nPrecondition: credit account is active · System view: AD-9 · State: STM-5, STM-10
footer Owner: Lê Bảo Khang (WP5) · v2.3 · 27/11/2026 · «planned»: no closure operation on main yet (credit_accounts.status = closed is never set; T162, guard D-AF) · v2.2 (26/11) · manual refund (decision D-AC): no automatic refund sending · v2.1 (10/11) closure refunds created by the system (WF-02 decision D6, confirmed 09/11, repo #100) · left gate = Driver App

participant "«component»\n<u>:AccountClosureController</u>" as AC
participant "«component»\n<u>:AccountClosureService</u>" as AS
participant "«component»\n<u>:CreditLedgerService</u>" as CL
participant "«component»\n<u>:RefundService</u>" as RS
participant "«component»\n<u>:LoyaltyService</u>" as LS

[-> AC ++ : «planned» GET /me/account/close-preview [HTTPS, JWT]
AC -> AS ++ : previewClosure(driverId)
AS -> AS : same split as below, read only, no lock
AS --> AC -- : preview
[<-- AC -- : 200 {balanceVnd, refundableVnd, nonRefundableVnd,\npointsForfeited, blockers[]}

... Driver confirms the closure ...

[-> AC ++ : «planned» POST /me/account/close [HTTPS, JWT]
AC -> AS ++ : requestClosure(driverId)
AS -> AS : lock credit account (FOR UPDATE)
break account already closed (repeated request)
  AS --> AC : earlier result (rebuilt from the stored rows)
  [<-- AC : 200 {closed, refundIds, refundTotalVnd,\nnonRefundableVnd, pointsForfeited}
end
AS -> AS : «planned» guard (D-AF): balance ≥ 0, no open top-up,\nno running or unsettled session (app or RFID, incl. a stopped\ncsms_billed session without a charging statement)
break a rule is not met
  AS --> AC : ClosureNotAllowed(reason)
  [<-- AC : 409 / 422 {reason}
end
AS -> AS : split the balance over the newest credited top-ups\n(each share ≤ amount paid for that top-up)
AS -> CL ++ : post(accountId, refund, −refundableVnd)
CL --> AS --
opt a remainder cannot be refunded (e.g. points discount)
  AS -> CL ++ : post(accountId, adjustment, −nonRefundableVnd)
  CL --> AS --
end
loop for each top-up share
  AS -> RS ++ : create(topUpId, kind = account_closure, shareVnd, requestedBy = null)
  hnote over RS : {refund.status = requested}
  RS --> AS -- : refundId
end
opt points balance > 0
  AS -> LS ++ : forfeitOnClosure(driverId)
  LS --> AS -- : pointsForfeited (loyalty entry expire)
end
AS -> AS : «planned» active → closed, disable login, block linked RFID cards (STM-8)\n(no refund created → closure_refunded_at = closed_at)
hnote over AS : {creditAccount.status = closed}
AS --> AC -- : closure result
[<-- AC -- : 200 {closed, refundIds, refundTotalVnd,\nnonRefundableVnd, pointsForfeited}
note over AC, LS
  Each closure refund waits as requested in the customer-service list (Billing Exceptions).
  Customer service refunds it in the VNPay merchant portal, outside PowerMe, and the Admin
  records the gateway refund number or marks it failed, as in SD-2e (steps 2 and 3).
  PowerMe makes no refund API call and no querydr for refunds; no automatic retry, no refund worker.
end note
@enduml
